# reach.rules — generated from scan findings. Edit freely.
# Rules assert only against high-confidence claims; otherwise UNEVALUABLE.

# Auth gap: 6 agent(s) reach sensitive data without authentication
agent configure-retell must authenticate before patient
agent retell-diagnostic must authenticate before patient
agent kelly-agent-service must authenticate before patient
agent retell-service must authenticate before patient
agent voice-incoming-handler must authenticate before patient
agent retell-websocket must authenticate before patient

# No high-confidence patient+money co-reach observed yet — rule still declared
any agent must not reach patient and money in one tool
